                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} D_\alpha \times X \to X
              is exhibited by the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinitesimal+shape+modality"} infinitesimal shape modality
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi ʃ
                      %mi inf
                    %mo ≔
                    %msup
                      %mi i
                      %mo *
                    %msub
                      %mi i
