            %h6#remark_4 Remark
            %p
              Def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ExhibitingInfinitesimalCohesion"}
              expresses the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinitesimal+cohesion"} infinitesimal
